{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52719","headline":"丹元子步天歌 东方七宿 一 · 王希明","name":"丹元子步天歌 东方七宿 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"角，两星南北正直着，中有平道上天田，总是黑星两相连，别有一乌名进贤。\n平道右畔独渊然，最上三星周鼎形，角下天门左平星，双双横於库楼上，库楼十星屈曲明。\n楼中五柱十五星，三三相着如鼎形。\n其中四星别名衡，南门楼外两星横。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王希明","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52719.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52719","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}